-- makes each row independently checkable without a join back to a header.
--
-- The old side runs on the OLD database and writes nothing there: the text
-- w9.digest_body('old', ...) returns is a bare SELECT, which
-- migrate-from-go.sh wraps in a COPY ... TO STDOUT and loads into w9.recon.
-- The metric list is filtered through w9.source_column first, so a column
